# ─── AUDIT LOG (append only) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────

audit_log:
  - timestamp: 2026-04-22T00:00:00Z
    actor: claude-pro (Lead LLM Architect)
    action: INIT — created ROADMAP.md, BACKLOG.md, STANDARDS.md, .system_state, ai-skills.json
    branch: claude/setup-roadmap-docs-1Y9gM
    notes: Phase 1 (Foundation) complete. Flat-first hierarchy established.

  - timestamp: 2026-04-22T01:00:00Z
    actor: claude-pro (Lead LLM Architect)
    action: BUG HUNT — full static + logic audit of all source packages
    branch: claude/setup-roadmap-docs-1Y9gM
    notes: >
      20 bugs identified and inserted at top of BACKLOG.md as BUG-001–BUG-020.
      CRITICAL (3): goroutine leak sidecar, shadow invocation goroutine leak, context.Background() escape in LoadModule.
      HIGH (5): TOCTOU race wazero invoke/unload, Redis silent data loss, event bus close/publish panic,
                unchecked w.Write() errors, compiled module memory leak.
      MEDIUM (6): empty service ID bypass, json_store nil map, log observer flush race,
                  metric observer map race, uint32 truncation, blocking event bus subscriber.
      LOW (5): CPU DoS log sanitization, ignored config error, sentinel stack traces, p99 edge case, retry overflow, regex test gap.

  - timestamp: 2026-04-22T02:00:00Z
    actor: claude-pro (Lead LLM Architect)
    action: BUG FIX SPRINT — all 20 bugs resolved via granular commits
    branch: claude/setup-roadmap-docs-1Y9gM
    notes: >
      17 real defects fixed across 17 individual commits (one per bug).
      3 entries confirmed non-bugs after deep code review: BUG-011 (log observer copy-clear already correct),
      BUG-014 (event bus already uses buffered channels + non-blocking sends),
      BUG-019 (retry already has maxBackoff clamp).
      Fix highlights: BUG-004 per-module closedCh eliminates TOCTOU race;
      BUG-008 compiledRefs+evictedCompiled ref-counting closes evicted wazero modules safely;
      BUG-003 lifecycleCtx bounds all LoadModule goroutines to host lifetime.
      All 17 test packages green. go test -race clean.
    bugs_fixed: [BUG-001, BUG-002, BUG-003, BUG-004, BUG-005, BUG-006, BUG-007, BUG-008,
                 BUG-009, BUG-010, BUG-012, BUG-013, BUG-015, BUG-016, BUG-017, BUG-018, BUG-020]
    bugs_no_action: [BUG-011, BUG-014, BUG-019]
